@startuml class-before
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Malgun Gothic"
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide circle
left to right direction
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam ranksep 80
skinparam nodesep 70

interface Cell <<interface>> {
  + figureNextState()
  + transition()
  + redraw()
  + userClicked()
  + transfer()
  + create()
}

class Neighborhood {
  - gridSize
  + transition()
  + redraw()
}

class Resident {
  - {static} LIVE_COLOR
  - amAlive
  - willBeAlive
  + transition()
  + redraw()
  + userClicked()
  + transfer()
}

class Universe {
  - {static} theInstance
  + {static} instance()
  + paint()
  - refreshNow()
}

class Clock {
  + {static} instance()
  + addClockListener()
}

Cell <|.. Neighborhood
Cell <|.. Resident
Neighborhood "1\n\n" *-up-> "64\n\n" Cell
Resident -[hidden]right- Neighborhood
Universe "1<U+2003>" -right-> "1<U+2003>" Cell
Universe .left.> Clock : <<use>>
Universe ..> Resident : <<create>>

note right of Resident
  살아 있는 셀의 색은 redraw()가
  상수 LIVE_COLOR로 정한다
end note
note left of Universe
  Resident를 프로토타입으로 판을 만들고,
  시계에 틱 리스너를 등록한다
end note
@enduml
